    dcterms:created "2026-03-11T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:description "DBpedia is a community knowledge graph published as RDF and built from structured content extracted from Wikipedia and related Wikimedia data. It is accessible through linked data URIs, a public SPARQL endpoint, and continuously updated releases distributed through the DBpedia Databus." ;
