    dcterms:description "Genome-to-Treatment (GTRx) is a NCATS Translator knowledge provider exposed through a BioThings API. It contains recommended acute treatments and interventions for seriously ill newborns, infants, and children with newly diagnosed genetic diseases, including therapeutics, dietary changes, surgery, medical devices, and other interventions." ;
