    dcterms:created "2026-05-26T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:description "Raras is a Brazilian Portuguese-language rare disease knowledge platform and knowledge graph that connects diseases, phenotypes, genes, and patient-facing information. The platform presents a rare disease encyclopedia and knowledge map spanning more than 10,000 diseases, 11,000 phenotypes, and 5,000 genes." ;
