    dcterms:created "2026-08-12T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:description "An open canine genetics atlas covering breed-stratified variant data, canine disease associations, and dog-to-human gene orthology, published with an evidence-graded, Biolink-conformant knowledge graph." ;
