    dcterms:description "Wikipedia is a free, collaboratively edited multilingual encyclopedia published by the Wikimedia movement. Its article content is widely reused as an open reference source and serves as a primary upstream source for derivative resources such as DBpedia. Wikipedia content is accessible through the web portal, public APIs, and Wikimedia dump infrastructure." ;
