    dcterms:description "Organisations named graph, the subset of the EURIO Knowledge Graph covering the organizations participating in funded projects. Distributed as a zipped N-Quads file of approximately 100 MB, and also available in RDF/XML, Turtle, N-Triples, and JSON-LD." ;
    schema1:url <https://cordis.europa.eu/data/cordis-organisationNamedGraph-nq.zip> .

kgr:eurio.projects-graph a schema1:GraphProduct ;
